    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>your mandatory training.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been randomly selected to participate in an essential <strong>Health &amp; Safety Course</strong> as part of your continued employment at <strong>CloudCorp Solutions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please remain seated in your cubicle.</strong> Follow all instructions provided by Clou-D. Complete each assigned task efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DO NOT DEVIATE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>DO NOT ASK QUESTIONS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>DO NOT ATTEMPT TO LEAVE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your compliance ensures a smooth training experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to comply\u2026 is not recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050020/extras/86ac55f9ff389d81e8d7e60244b94f45.poster.avif?t=1750194828\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050020/extras/86ac55f9ff389d81e8d7e60244b94f45.webm?t=1750194828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050020/extras/86ac55f9ff389d81e8d7e60244b94f45.mp4?t=1750194828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050020/extras/0d6dedc4885afd2f85c520c578cf74b2.poster.avif?t=1750194828\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050020/extras/0d6dedc4885afd2f85c520c578cf74b2.webm?t=1750194828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic